SALOON POS – FEATURE LIST 

1️⃣ User & Role Management 
Roles (phase 1)
• Admin (Full Access) 
• Employee (Limited Access) 

Admin Features 
• Create / Edit / Disable employees 
• Assign roles 
• View all system data 
• View financial reports 
• Manage services & pricing 
• Manage inventory 
• Configure commission rules 
• System settings access 

Employee Features 
• Login securely 
• Add their own tasks 
• View their task history 
• Mark tasks as completed 
• View their own performance summary 
• View commission summary (optional) 
 
 
 2️⃣ Service Management (phase 1)
• Create service categories (Hair, Makeup, Facial, etc.) 
• Add / Edit / Disable services 
• Set: 
  o Service price 
  o Duration 
  o Commission rule (% or fixed) 
• Attach required products to service (optional) 
• Create service packages / combos 
 
 3️⃣ Employee Task Management (Self-
Entry) (phase 1)
Employee Side 
• Add new task: 
  o Select service 
  o Select or add customer 
  o Add notes 
  o Add products used 
  o Set start time / end time 
• Mark status: 
  o In Progress 
  o Completed 
  o Cancelled 
• View: 
  o Today’s tasks 
  o Task history 
  o Total services completed 
  o Revenue generated 
   
 
Admin Side 
• View all employee tasks 
• Filter by: 
  o Date 
  o Employee 
  o Service 
• Edit tasks (optional) 
• Lock past records 
• Task productivity report 

⚠ Important decision: 
• Can employee edit price? yes
• Can employee delete completed task? no 
(Strongly recommend: NO, or require admin approval) 
 
 
